pr-studio
=========

Third-party software and assets used by this project. Packages are installed from npm or PyPI and models are
downloaded by `prs doctor`; none of them is stored in this repository except where noted.

Bundled into rendered videos
- Inter (fallback typeface), SIL Open Font License 1.1, via @fontsource/inter.
- JetBrains Mono (code typeface where Menlo, Cascadia Mono and Consolas are missing, e.g. Linux), SIL Open Font
  License 1.1, via @fontsource/jetbrains-mono.
- Fluent UI System Icons, MIT License, Microsoft Corporation: the icons pr-studio draws are copied into theme/icons.js.
- Shiki (syntax colors, VS Code Light+ theme), MIT License.
- qrcode (end card QR code), MIT License.

Used at build time
- esbuild (MIT), Playwright (Apache-2.0) with Chrome for Testing, jsQR (Apache-2.0), pngjs (MIT), FFmpeg (LGPL/GPL,
  via imageio-ffmpeg, BSD-2-Clause wrapper).
- faster-whisper (MIT) and the Whisper small.en model (MIT, OpenAI) for word timing and the sync gate.
- Kokoro-82M (Apache-2.0, hexgrad) via kokoro-onnx (MIT), the offline narration voice.
- MAI-Voice-2 through Azure AI Speech, when you configure your own Azure resource.

Not distributed
- Aptos is read in place from a local Microsoft Office installation when present; it is never copied into this
  repository or its outputs. Without Office, videos use Segoe UI or Inter.

Microsoft, the Microsoft logo, Visual Studio Code and VS Code are trademarks of Microsoft Corporation. The end card
and title frame show the Microsoft logo; use the videos within the scope your organization allows.

The catalog stills (the pictures of the diagram treatments) are rendered from made-up demo data.

Slide decks (deck/)
- Brand marks in deck/theme/logos/ come from Simple Icons (CC0-1.0, https://simpleicons.org), except `vscode` (the
  Visual Studio Code logo, from microsoft/vscode, MIT). The marks stay their owners' trademarks: use them only to name
  a company or where a link goes.
- The layout samples (deck/samples/) are made-up demo data about a fictional company (Contoso).
